915b55f4b5ee4f7cb477905506066600225deeecd413a4955226fdbad974e015e053f7fc76700da615b5639daab01adc50b5b5a22c2c4556e4ae6073049c0ed4  0001-q6voiced-actually-start-the-voice-PCM-streams.patch
"
